References: <5110F3C0.60301@ipgovernance.eu>
Message-ID: <5110FAA6.1030602@eawag.ch>

Hi Sebastian,

Try this:

persons <- c("Sam", "Sam", "Sam", "Greg", "Tom", "Tom", "Tom", "Mary", 
"Mary")
groups <- c("a", "b", "c", "a", "b", "c", "d", "b", "d")
df <- data.frame(cbind(persons, groups))
tab <- table(df)

The 'tab' object contains your matrix.

Best,
Philip

