Hi,

You need to recreate the control list. I.e.,

maxNumDyads=network.size(net)^2
control=control.ergm(MPLE.max.dyad.types=maxNumDyads, MCMC.burnin=1000000, MCMC.samplesize=300000, parallel=6)
fit = ergm(net ~ mutual + transitive+ nodecov("missing") + nodematch("region") + nodematch("income_level") + gwidegree(0.3), control=control, verbose=TRUE)

                                    Pavel

