Hi Ravi-

The issue seems to be with "base=-2".  The base argument lists the 
positions of the statistics to be excluded; if your intention was to 
leave out the 2nd of the possible statistics associated with this term, 
then it should be "base=2".  That is, the negative sign, in the sense of 
exclusion, is already implicit.  Once you take out the negative sign 
from your code, though, there is still an issue of an incorrect number 
of statistics being passed, which makes me think that perhaps you are 
intending something else.  If so, feel free to email the group or to me 
one on one and I can try to ascertain.

Cheers,
Steve



