> net2%e%"att" <- df$edge
This is wrong and the results are not predicable. You need to use an
adjacency matrix. See the following examples.

> net3 <- network(matrix(1,3,3))
> set.edge.attribute(net3,"att", c(1:6))
> net3%e%"att"
[1] 1 2 3 4 5 6
> net3%e%"att2" <- c(c(0,1,2),c(3,0,4),c(5,6,0))
> net3%e%"att2"
[1] 1 2 3 4 5 6
> net3%e%"att3" <- c(1:6)
> net3%e%"att3"
[1] 2 3 4 6 1 2

Best,
Yun

