Hi Greg,

This is a very interesting question.  It's not really possible to break 
a single complete network into a "test" and "training" set, without 
modifying the very structural features that ERGM is designed to model.

If you happen to have two (or more) observations of the network of 
interest you could train on one and test on the other.

best,
Martina


