I apologize for sending this question too quickly.  The problem was that I used the add.edge function incorrectly.

The correct way to add multiple edges is

add.edges(n, c(1,2), c(2,3))

Note that it's add.edges(), not add.edge().

The edge.check=T argument of add.edge and add.edges will help catch mistakes of this kind.

