Message-ID: <alpine.WNT.1.10.1308141047200.6512@morrism-PC>

Your p-value is not significant.  But you need to have both nodefactor and 
nodematch in the equation to test this properly.

Please read our paper "Birds of a Feather..." (Goodreau, Kitts and Morris) 
to understand how to model homophily properly in a network.

